          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "Net-(U8-OSC2) : C8.1(passive) U8.7(OSC2,output) Y2.3(3,passive)"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "C8 | 18pF 50V | Capacitor_SMD:C_0603_1608Metric | Device:C | Unpolarized capacitor"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "MCP2515-xSO CAN controllers; `Y1`, `Y2` — 16MHz crystals"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The 0.1uF capacitor will heavily load U8's crystal oscillator, likely preventing the MCP2515 for CAN0 from oscillating and making CAN0 nonfunctional.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain a clear crystal-load capacitor error: C10 is 0.1uF instead of the expected ~18pF, which would likely stop U8's CAN oscillator from working."
}

